Package: deskarcade
Version: @VERSION@
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Imperium Games <maintainer@example.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libx11-6, libxext6, libxi6, libxrandr2, libxcursor1, libxfixes3, libice6, libsm6, libfontconfig1, libpulse0, procps
Recommends: libgl1, libssl3t64 | libssl3, gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Description: Mini-games that play on top of your desktop
 Shoot hoops, fire arrows and juggle a ball in a transparent overlay while
 you wait for builds or AI agents to finish. Clicks outside the game pass
 through to your windows, and balls can land on the tops of open windows.
